From bb97b8c7139e42d81ce266d5ea3c61fb8dd76616 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Wiklander <jens.wiklander@linaro.org>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 09:40:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 906/913] ta: pkcs11: enforce separation of data and key
 encryption

Add a check for PKCS11_FUNCTION_WRAP and PKCS11_FUNCTION_UNWRAP that the
key doesn't allow data encryption or decryption for in-depth hardening
against key injection and key extraction attacks.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git ef4aea7de3b6cc5428bdd1a22fd9cd9bb6d38514 ta: pkcs11: enforce separation of data and key encryption]
Fixes: 3668310bd696 ("ta: pkcs11: Add implementation for unwrapping keys")
Fixes: 5f80f270b184 ("ta: pkcs11: Add implementation for wrapping keys")
Change-Id: I9fce04bf104b27ab618570106383d7efa1a3ffcc
Signed-off-by: Jens Wiklander <jens.wiklander@linaro.org>
Reviewed-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@st.com>
(cherry picked from commit a33d6483e4be0715a742a9fb51b4afd3e5b14be7)
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/613409
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 ta/pkcs11/src/pkcs11_attributes.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ta/pkcs11/src/pkcs11_attributes.c b/ta/pkcs11/src/pkcs11_attributes.c
index 9b7f911c3..c6f174f91 100644
--- a/ta/pkcs11/src/pkcs11_attributes.c
+++ b/ta/pkcs11/src/pkcs11_attributes.c
@@ -2123,6 +2123,16 @@ check_parent_attrs_against_processing(enum pkcs11_mechanism_id proc_id,
 		return PKCS11_CKR_KEY_FUNCTION_NOT_PERMITTED;
 	}
 
+	if (function == PKCS11_FUNCTION_WRAP ||
+	    function == PKCS11_FUNCTION_UNWRAP) {
+		/* Enforce separation of Data and Key encryption */
+		if (get_bool(head, PKCS11_CKA_DECRYPT) ||
+		    get_bool(head, PKCS11_CKA_ENCRYPT)) {
+			DMSG("Must not use data encryption keys for wrap/unwrap");
+			return PKCS11_CKR_KEY_FUNCTION_NOT_PERMITTED;
+		}
+	}
+
 	return PKCS11_CKR_OK;
 }
 
